# Muldrotha, the Gravetide: "During each of your turns, you may play a land and cast a permanent spell of each permanent type from your
# graveyard. (If a card has multiple permanent types, choose one as you play it.)" Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with a Thought Scour
# (milling Elvish Mystic and Ornithopter and drawing a Forest), and Bot2's Hymn to Tourach discards the Forest. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Elvish
